// Windows resources for MetaVisage.exe (Sprint 10.5).
//
// GLFW_ICON is the resource name GLFW's Win32 backend loads as the window
// class icon, so this one entry sets the Explorer, title bar and taskbar
// icons. CMake configures this file with the absolute icon path (see
// CMakeLists.txt). Regenerate the .ico with resources/build-ico.ps1.
GLFW_ICON ICON "@METAVISAGE_ICON_PATH@"
